{"id":"weiterhin","lemma":"weiterhin","pos":"adv","rank":1415,"glosses":["still","also, going further","farther, further"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/De-weiterhin.ogg/De-weiterhin.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ihre Mutter wird weiterhin arbeiten.","en":"Her mother will continue to work.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"Wir benutzen es lieber weiterhin.","en":"We'd prefer to keep using it.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to make use"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},null]},{"text":"Ich will weiterhin bei Tom arbeiten.","en":"I want to keep working for Tom.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"at / with"},null,{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"Leiste nur weiterhin so gute Arbeit.","en":"Keep up the good work.","words":[{"g":"to perform","l":"leisten"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"so"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"toil"}]},{"text":"Wir werden auch weiterhin zusammenarbeiten.","en":"We'll continue cooperating.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"also"},null,{"g":"to work together"}]}]}